From c634018654d19d46cf603ff34db6b12b7b86e29e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Willy Tarreau <w@1wt.eu>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 16:01:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] slz: count brotli distance cache hits in SLZ_STATS

To estimate what brotli's distance cache (RFC7932 section 4) would bring
to a stateless encoder, SLZ_STATS now simulates its ring of the last 4
distances (initialized to 4, 11, 15, 16) on the references emitted, and
counts the short distance codes they would use: 0 = last distance (and
among them those with insert <= 9 and copy <= 69, whose insert-and-copy
code implies the distance at no cost), 1-3 = 2nd to 4th last, 4-9 = last
+-1..3, 10-15 = 2nd last +-1..3. All codes but 0 push the distance.

On a miss, the 16 cached distances are also tried at the match position:
if one gives the same length, a cache-aware encoder would have used it,
so it is counted as a hit ("switch") and the ring follows that choice;
if one only gives a shorter match (>= 4), it is counted apart. The ring
is shared by all calls of a stream. It also reports the fixed tree
distance bits of the hits, i.e. what short codes would replace.

Results, % of references (columns: code0 incl. free, then the free ones,
codes 1-3, 4-9, 10-15, total hits incl. switched, switched alone, fixed
tree distance bits of the hits in bytes, misses with a shorter cached
match only):

  corpus  lvl k        totout      refs  code0   free    c1-3    c4-9  c10-15    hits  switch  hitbits   short
  hap-org  1   16      354239     64437  3.58%  3.07%   4.50%   2.90%   3.34%  14.33%   7.45%    14340   0.81%
  hap-org  1   32      336267     67698  3.52%  3.03%   4.22%   2.39%   3.16%  13.29%   7.61%    14653   0.80%
  hap-org  1   4096    281718     76071  3.26%  2.75%   4.19%   1.86%   2.90%  12.21%   7.39%    15733   0.79%
  hap-org  4   16      325039     71400  3.39%  2.92%   4.18%   2.75%   3.19%  13.50%   6.97%    14953   0.77%
  hap-org  4   32      304658     73567  3.32%  2.87%   4.26%   2.30%   3.03%  12.91%   7.23%    15377   0.79%
  hap-org  4   4096    280766     76105  3.29%  2.78%   4.21%   1.86%   2.90%  12.25%   7.43%    15803   0.79%
  hap-org  T   16      275939     71387  3.37%  2.90%   4.18%   2.75%   3.19%  13.49%   6.95%    14928   0.77%
  hap-org  T   32      260769     73563  3.31%  2.86%   4.26%   2.30%   3.03%  12.90%   7.22%    15368   0.78%
  hap-org  T   4096    243184     76088  3.28%  2.77%   4.20%   1.86%   2.89%  12.24%   7.43%    15788   0.79%
  silesia  1   16    111359081  14086021 10.21%  9.86%   9.00%   2.00%   2.27%  23.48%   9.09%  4602466   1.43%
  silesia  1   32    107816032  14825368  9.42%  9.09%   8.62%   1.66%   2.17%  21.86%   9.14%  4663637   1.45%
  silesia  1   4096  98783584  16598887  8.29%  8.00%   7.90%   1.24%   1.99%  19.42%   8.99%  4859597   1.41%
  silesia  4   16    100476303  16615306  9.43%  9.05%   8.38%   1.85%   2.07%  21.73%   8.42%  5056625   1.30%
  silesia  4   32    96588868  17351141  8.71%  8.36%   7.99%   1.54%   1.97%  20.21%   8.46%  5073478   1.31%
  silesia  4   4096  91360519  18719547  7.77%  7.46%   7.44%   1.16%   1.81%  18.19%   8.41%  5137459   1.30%
  silesia  T   16    99931392  15268296  9.13%  8.79%   8.27%   1.96%   2.20%  21.57%   8.47%  4605822   1.35%
  silesia  T   32    95140431  16299687  8.56%  8.24%   7.94%   1.60%   2.06%  20.15%   8.53%  4755019   1.35%
